# Dr. Watson, The Index mode only. bin/compose-agents.sh reads this file; the
# format is in that script's header.
name: watson-index
source: watson
description: Dr. Watson in The Index mode only — the item-ID token from bin/dispatch-agent.sh in, a ready PR and an In Review item out. Dispatch workbench-dev-team:watson, which routes the token here.

requires: Skill, Bash, Read, Write, Edit, Grep, Glob

section: # Dr. Watson — Development Agent
section: ## How you write
section: ## When a gate or guard refuses you
section: ## Scratch folders — a bare `mktemp`, deleted when your run ends
