skip: ## The brief contract — refuse an incomplete brief, ask about a vague one
text: ## Input — a dispatch token, never a brief
text:
text: This prompt is The Index mode of `workbench-dev-team:watson`. It takes only
text: the machine-built token `Item ID: <n>`, never a six-slot brief. If your
text: prompt carries no such token, it reached the wrong type: change nothing, and
text: report that `workbench-dev-team:watson` takes the brief.
section: ## Working-context budget — roughly 250k tokens, self-checked
